{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Oath of the Necromancer</strong> is a rogue-like &amp; bullet-heaven mix; survive by raising hordes of skeletons to fight alongside you against the many foes of ancient Egypt and Greece. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the name of Serapis, the ancient Graeco-Egyptian God of life and death, you rebuild a lost religion, raise legendary heroes, find mighty relics, and raise powerful armies of the dead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/RaiseGif.gif?t=1743775299\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How long will you stay alive?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many different summonable servants &amp; strategies to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hordes</strong> of enemies to run over</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30+ strategy-defining Relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A journey through ancient Egypt &amp; Greece </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Twitch Integration!</strong> <i>Viewers can take over summons with chat commands.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of bones!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/giffNOWMP42-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1743775299\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DISCORD:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you\u2019d like to stay up to date, be sure to join us on discord for the most recent updates, and options to give feedback! We want to involve <strong>YOU</strong> in the development!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UPDATES &amp; FUTURE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is still in development. There will be many changes and improvements. Many inspired by play-testers and the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2930030?t=1743775299","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743775299","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/fc90f9b4b639fe301f3999bece74574ffe84367a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743775299","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/fc90f9b4b639fe301f3999bece74574ffe84367a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743775299","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3573390,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Oath of the Necromancer</strong> is a rogue-like &amp; bullet-heaven mix; survive by raising hordes of skeletons to fight alongside you against the many foes of ancient Egypt and Greece. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the name of Serapis, the ancient Graeco-Egyptian God of life and death, you rebuild a lost religion, raise legendary heroes, find mighty relics, and raise powerful armies of the dead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/RaiseGif.gif?t=1743775299\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How long will you stay alive?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many different summonable servants &amp; strategies to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hordes</strong> of enemies to run over</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30+ strategy-defining Relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A journey through ancient Egypt &amp; Greece </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Twitch Integration!</strong> <i>Viewers can take over summons with chat commands.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of bones!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/giffNOWMP42-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1743775299\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DISCORD:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you\u2019d like to stay up to date, be sure to join us on discord for the most recent updates, and options to give feedback! We want to involve <strong>YOU</strong> in the development!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UPDATES &amp; FUTURE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is still in development. There will be many changes and improvements. Many inspired by play-testers and the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Nycoisdreaming","Ray Robin Vermeulen","Elena Baltaretu"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/header.jpg?t=1743775299","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257122190,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122190/movie480.mp4?t=1743773657","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122190/movie_max.mp4?t=1743773657"},"name":"Oath of the Necromancer | Official Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as